  "honest_framing": "Data source: 5 ckpts per metal (Ru/Ir/Os/Rh/Re) on MetalCytoToxDB Ru/Ir/Os/Rh/Re subsets with Wf-120 P2 5-seed expansion (seeds 0-4). Model: D-MPNN multi-task with pIC50 regression head + Wasserstein pIC50 reg + L2 grad-norm guard. Protocol: 30 epochs per ckpt, scaffold split, n_train varies per metal (Ru=2509, Ir=784, Rh=60, Os=66, Re=121). Krasnov 2026 baseline cite-only; iMoLD cite-only. Smaller metals (Rh n=60, Os n=66, Re n=121) suffer sample-size ceiling \u2014 flagged as STABLE_BUT_HIGH_STD with std > 0.15. Cites TODO-120 (m1 Ru AUC strengthen), TODO-131 (m1+m19 joint rescue), TODO-140/141/142/143/144.",
